    "title": "South Ward donation drive at one-third mark - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Bob Shraluka ,\n1 days ago As September turns into October, the capital campaign to raise funds for a major update to South Ward Park in Decatur is near the one-third mark. As of Sept. 29, $16,500 had been raised with 35 days to go, according to Parks Superintendent Cara Gerber. Nov. 3 is the deadline... Read full article",
